apshot-action-finalization-map=\"${escapeHtml(settlementFinalizationPolicy.finalizationMap)}\">动作摘要收尾状态：${escapeHtml(settlementFinalizationPolicy.finalizationLabel)}</span><span class=\"worklog-run-chip\">动作摘要收尾依据：${escapeHtml(settlementFinalizationPolicy.finalizationHint)}</span><span class=\"worklog-run-chip\" data-snapshot-action-archive-state=\"${escapeHtml(finalizationArchivePolicy.archiveState)}\" data-snapshot-action-archive-map=\"${escapeHtml(finalizationArchivePolicy.archiveMap)}\">动作摘要归档状态：${escapeHtml(finalizationArchivePolicy.archiveLabel)}</span><span class=\"worklog-run-chip\">动作摘要归档依据：${escapeHtml(finalizationArchivePolicy.archiveHint)}</span><span class=\"worklog-run-chip\" data-snapshot-action-archive-receipt=\"${escapeHtml(archiveReceiptPolicy.receiptState)}\" data-snapshot-action-archive-receipt-map=\"${escapeHtml(archiveReceiptPolicy.receiptMap)}\">动作摘要归档确认：${escapeHtml(archiveReceiptPolicy.receiptLabel)}</span><span class=\"worklog-run-chip\">动作摘要归档确认依据：${escapeHtml(archiveReceiptPolicy.receiptHint)}</span><span class=\"worklog-run-chip\" data-snapshot-action-retention-state=\"${escapeHtml(archiveRetentionPolicy.retentionState)}\" data-snapshot-action-retention-map=\"${escapeHtml(archiveRetentionPolicy.retentionMap)}\">动作摘要留存状态：${escapeHtml(archiveRetentionPolicy.retentionLabel)}</span><span class=\"worklog-run-chip\">动作摘要留存依据：${escapeHtml(archiveRetentionPolicy.retentionHint)}</span><span class=\"worklog-run-chip\" data-snapshot-action-retention-verification=\"${escapeHtml(retentionVerificationPolicy.verificationState)}\" data-snapshot-action-retention-verification-map=\"${escapeHtml(retentionVerificationPolicy.verificationMap)}\">动作摘要留存校验：${escapeHtml(retentionVerificationPolicy.verificationLabel)}</span><span class=\"worklog-run-chip\">动作摘要校验依据：${escapeHtml(retentionVerificationPolicy.verificationHint)}</span><span class=\"worklog-run-chip\" data-snapshot-action-verification-closure=\"${escapeHtml(verificationClosurePolicy.closureState)}\" da